          <Pad Id="VsrDXr5NCAvm9zHxn1R93f" Bounds="60,236,520,40" ShowValueBox="true" isIOBox="true" Value="&lt; Three kinds of element: a node is a point, a way a line of nodes (closed, an area), a relation a group (a building with courtyards, a bus route).">
